{
  "_comment": [
    "The ground loot's looks and sounds (modules/mod-stat-growth/src/GroundLoot.cpp): what a boss throws out on the",
    "floor for each player, Diablo-style. Imported by localTools/ascensionImport/importVisuals.py: the models from",
    "Ascension - creature looks (the bag on the floor, the gold, the light beam tinted to each item quality), which",
    "localTools/patchSinisterStrike.ps1 gives creature displays - and the sounds Diablo IV's loot makes, extracted to",
    "data/custom/diabloLootSounds (local). The server plays the sounds itself, by the ids given here, to the drop's",
    "owner alone (SMSG_PLAY_SOUND, SMSG_PLAY_OBJECT_SOUND): a kit's own sound was never heard when the server played",
    "the kit, so the kits only sparkle. The Loop* sounds are the beams' own, played as long as one stands",
    "(CreatureSoundData), brought up to the game's level: Diablo IV mixes them far under the rest."
  ],
